      {"id":"campus-q2","question":"再数这组点。哪张点图和它同样多？","skill":"campus-count","visual":{"kind":"picture","alt":"题干点图","picture":{"layout":"rows","groups":[{"cells":[{"glyph":"•"},{"glyph":"•"},{"glyph":"•"},{"glyph":"•"},{"glyph":"•"}]},{"cells":[{"glyph":"•"},{"glyph":"•"},{"glyph":"•"}]}]}},"answer":["C"],"analysis":"数过一个就记住一个，最后数到八。只有八个点的图片和题目一样多。","options":{"A":{"label":"点图一","visual":{"kind":"picture","alt":"点图一","picture":{"layout":"rows","groups":[{"cells":[{"glyph":"•"},{"glyph":"•"},{"glyph":"•"},{"glyph":"•"},{"glyph":"•"}]},{"cells":[{"glyph":"•"},{"glyph":"•"},{"glyph":"•"},{"glyph":"•"}]}]}}},"B":{"label":"点图二","visual":{"kind":"picture","alt":"点图二","picture":{"layout":"rows","groups":[{"cells":[{"glyph":"•"},{"glyph":"•"},{"glyph":"•"}]},{"cells":[{"glyph":"•"},{"glyph":"•"},{"glyph":"•"},{"glyph":"•"}]}]}}},"C":{"label":"点图三","visual":{"kind":"picture","alt":"点图三","picture":{"layout":"rows","groups":[{"cells":[{"glyph":"•"},{"glyph":"•"},{"glyph":"•"},{"glyph":"•"}]},{"cells":[{"glyph":"•"},{"glyph":"•"},{"glyph":"•"},{"glyph":"•"}]}]}}}}},
      {"id":"campus-q3","question":"看物品的外边。哪一个圆圆的？","skill":"campus-shape","answer":["A"],"analysis":"钟面的外边圆圆的；书封面和黑板外边长长方方的。","options":{"A":{"label":"挂钟","visual":{"kind":"asset","image":"clock","alt":"圆形挂钟"}},"B":{"label":"书","visual":{"kind":"asset","image":"book","alt":"长方形书封面"}},"C":{"label":"黑板","visual":{"kind":"asset","image":"board","alt":"长方形黑板"}}}},
      {"id":"campus-q4","question":"换一组。哪一个外面长长方方的？","skill":"campus-shape","answer":["B"],"analysis":"黑板的外边长长方方的；皮球和钟面的外边圆圆的。","options":{"A":{"label":"皮球","visual":{"kind":"asset","image":"ball","alt":"圆圆的皮球"}},"B":{"label":"黑板","visual":{"kind":"asset","image":"board","alt":"长方形黑板"}},"C":{"label":"挂钟","visual":{"kind":"asset","image":"clock","alt":"圆形挂钟"}}}}
    ]},
    {"key":"summary","type":"slide","title":"把方法带回家","template":"summary","data":{"title":"校园里的数学发现","items":["按顺序看，不漏看","一个一个数，只数一次","数过做标记，防重漏","发现数与形，说给大人听"]},"script":[
      {"spotlight":"item-1"},{"say":"今天，我们按顺序观察校园。"},{"say":"一次看一个地方，更容易看仔细。"},
      {"spotlight":"item-2"},{"say":"数物品时，一个对应一个数。"},{"say":"最后数到几，这组就有几个。"},
      {"spotlight":"item-3"},{"say":"物品多了，数过就做一个记号。"},{"say":"这样能分清哪些还没有数过。"},
      {"spotlight":"item-4"},{"say":"我们还发现圆圆的和长长方方的外观。"},{"say":"请大人陪你找身边的数和形。"},{"say":"再把发现说给大人听一听。"},{"say":"你的口头表达，仍需要大人观察。"}
    ]}
